  "q": {
   "en": "How many of these are empty? $\\{x \\in \\mathbb{N} : x < 1\\}$, $\\{0\\}$, $\\{x \\in \\mathbb{R} : x^2 < 0\\}$, $\\{\\emptyset\\}$",
   "hi": "इनमें से कितने empty हैं? $\\{x \\in \\mathbb{N} : x < 1\\}$, $\\{0\\}$, $\\{x \\in \\mathbb{R} : x^2 < 0\\}$, $\\{\\emptyset\\}$"
  },
